                                                "sense_id": "eedfde5b-b7b6-3b77-b9ea-7117925f3d25",
                                                "text": "But I made a vow to the moon and stars / That I'd search the honky-tonks and bars / And kill that man who gave me that awful name"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ad00311-a1ad-4ebe-9bb4-6d3bbcdc7007",
                                                "sense_id": "eedfde5b-b7b6-3b77-b9ea-7117925f3d25",
                                                "text": "Talking 'bout in Mexico (Mexico) / In a honky-tonk down in Mexico"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d94acc73-de59-405a-b139-045c2484a1bd",
                                                "sense_id": "eedfde5b-b7b6-3b77-b9ea-7117925f3d25",
                                                "text": "New honky-tonks have been popping up across the nation, even in blue states."
                                            }
